Message Types:
    sign up -
    type="signup",  email=string, password=string, uname=string

    log in -
    type="login", email=string, password=string

    message -
    type="message", text=string

    status -
    type="status", status=bool, text=string

    broadcast -
    type = "broadcast", title=string

    video search request -
    type = "search", keyword=string

    search result response -
    type = "result", results=list

    watch request -
    type = "watch", vid=int

    stream frame -
    type = "frame", "data"=jpeg_bytes

    audio -
    type = "audio", "data"=audio

    stream closed -
    type = "close"

    like -
    type="like"

    dislike -
    type="dislike"

    rsa key -
    type="rsa_key", key = rsa key

    aes key -
    type = "aes_key", key = aes key, iv = iv

Database fields:
    UName = The name of the user, not unique, changeable, Text (30)
    Password = The password for the user, should be hushed, Text (30)
    Email = User email, unique, Text (30)
    UID = User ID, auto-increment, unique
